; jsoo mirror of js/probe's [probes_native] library, over [native_js]/
; [native_op_walk_js]. See .ai/ (tail-call conversion, Stage 3). Wildcard
; glob is safe: no custom preprocessing on the source side.
;
; [probes_pure] is deliberately NOT mirrored (see .ai/js_backends_design.md
; and expr-tailcall-implementation-plan.md's "Mirroring and namespaces"): it
; is Expr-free, so ordinary [probes_pure] stays shared.
;
; The checked-in native_op_walk.ml shim (`include Native_op_walk_js.Native_op_walk`)
; matches the plan's documented pattern: [native_op_walk_js] is wrapped, so
; depending on it exposes only its own alias module, never a global
; [Native_op_walk].

(copy_files
 (files %{workspace_root}/js/probe/{probe_tensor_json,probe_native}.ml))

(library
 (name probes_native_js)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules probe_tensor_json probe_native native_op_walk)
 (libraries probes_pure native_js native_op_walk_js walk_core core err_trace))
